date":"2018-03-18T17:10:32-07:00","id":1196958,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1192005-are-there-any-anime-manga-light-novel-characters-that-could-be-beasts?p=1196951#post1196951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yup, got you the first time. The blue-book Horrors that just happen and nobody knows why, no splats or big powers involved.</div> </div> </div> </div>From a different perspective: I always saw playable splats as Horrors with more wordcount.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1192005-are-there-any-anime-manga-light-novel-characters-that-could-be-beasts?p=1196956#post1196956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What junji ito stories would be what and I think toimie to be a very old deva</div> </div> </div> </div>The funny thing about Tomie is that players familiar with the Chronicles of Darkness might assume she's a Galatean Promethean and try to act accordingly, only to realize that they made a big mistake. Aside from that, Junji Ito is full of Abyssal goodness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T00:52:20-07:00","id":1197074,"title":"","content":"You could make an argument that the Jinchuuriki from <i>Naruto </i>and <i>Naruto Shippuuden </i>(cursedbeitsname) could be Beasts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-21T23:13:10-07:00","id":1198255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1192005-are-there-any-anime-manga-light-novel-characters-that-could-be-beasts?p=1197074#post1197074\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could make an argument that the Jinchuuriki from <i>Naruto </i>and <i>Naruto Shippuuden </i>(cursedbeitsname) could be Beasts.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThough their Horrors have a lot less animalistic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","name":"Mangaholic13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-21T23:22:47-07:00","id":1198260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mangaholic13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1192005-are-there-any-anime-manga-light-novel-characters-that-could-be-beasts?p=1198255#post1198255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bThough their Horrors have a lot less animalistic.</div> </div> </div> </div>Point. They're also a bit too separate from the Jinchuuriki.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T02:23:49-07:00","id":1198275,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1192005-are-there-any-anime-manga-light-novel-characters-that-could-be-beasts?p=1198260#post1198260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Point. They're also a bit too separate from the Jinchuuriki.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bAnother good point... Though something like that happening (where a Horror is transferred from a Beast to a person) could make an interesting story...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","name":"Mangaholic13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T03:30:16-07:00","id":1198283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mangaholic13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1192005-are-there-any-anime-manga-light-novel-characters-that-could-be-beasts?p=1198275#post1198275\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bAnother good point... Though something like that happening (where a Horror is transferred from a Beast to a person) could make an interesting story...</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm thinking maybe an Obcasus Rite or other magic that allows the creation of 'artificial' Beasts by binding Unfettered into a person. It's a rather anime-ish idea actually. I'm not so sure about 'transplanting' actual Horrors, although that would certainly, as you say, make for an excellent plot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T11:24:14-07:00","id":1198366,"title":"","content":"Gaara certainly makes for a fitting Beast. Hunger: Predator, imo.<br /> Family: hm, not so sure, but tending towards Anakim.<br /> Atavisms: Unbreakable, Storm-Lashed (refluffed to using Sand instead of Lightning), Vengeful Earth and Skin Deep.<br /> Nightmares: Behold, my True Form, and You are Worthless.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T13:35:13-07:00","id":1198395,"title":"","content":"Another suggestion: <i>Toriko</i>!<br /> <br /> Think about it... Much of the series deals with Hunger and how it can affect people. And tell me intimidation doesn't seem a lot like <b>Behold, My True Form!</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":17107,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","user":"Mangaholic13","date":". 03-22-2018, 05:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","name":"Mangaholic13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T11:55:05-07:00","id":1199778,"title":"","content":"Sasuke works best as a hero I guess, but the Sasuke with Fuin works as a beast for fun - Inguma Nemesis, with Skin Deep (those marks, sharingan, those weird hand-wings, and long fingernails), Eye of Heaven (sharingan), alien mindset (no one understands his thought processes, and he can switch back and forth between destroy konoha, become their boss, kill my brother, avenge my brother...) Limb from Limb (Chidori) and Weakness Exposed (Sharingan). Nightmares to resemble illusion jutsu. <br /> <br /> Overlord's Entoma is a Namtaru Predator, with Unbreakable, Skin deep, limb from limb and Vengeful Earth refluffed to resemble insects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T00:53:01-07:00","id":1201176,"title":"","content":"Kurosaki Ichigo<br /> Inguma Tyrant<br /> Lightning Strike, skin deep (vizored/hollow-form), Storm-Lashed (swordbeams/getsuga tensho), alien mindset (hard-headedness, lateral thinking), Mimir's wisdom ('Zangetsu' dispensing advice), relentless hunter (obviously). Possibly monster from the deep as the hollow-form's fighting style. Unbreakable for Blut Vene.<br /> Inguma because he is somehow similar and connected to soul society, the hollows, the quincy, but always somehow fundamentally wrong, and is always the Outsider coming in. His Horror is Zangetsu/Shirosaki<br /> could be enabler rather than tyrant, change people's way of live after all.<br /> <br /> Naruto Uzumaki<br /> Namtaru Ravager Or Inguma Ravager<br /> Again, Outsider, people hate what he represents/are disgusted by his existence.<br /> He wants to become their ruler, but the horror's (original) desire is destruction.<br /> Relentless Hunter, Limb from limb (rasengan+derivatives), Skin deep (kyuubi mode), monster from the deep (kyuubi-chakra-arms, sage - Mode kata). Horrorspawn for kagebunshin, I guess.<br /> Horror is Kyuubi, ofc.<br /> <br /> Demiurge<br /> Namtaru Tyrant, with Skin deep (growing wings, feog-face), Wings of the raptor, breath of fire, unbreakable, shadowed soul, from the shadows, Mimir's wisdom and eye of heaven<br /> Nightmare: you are outmatched, you must obey.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T05:45:54-07:00","id":1209203,"title":"","content":"Nurarihion No Mago<br /> Eshmaki Tirant with dominating From The Shadows atavism. Pretty much a perfect fit for the Beast. <br /> <br /> Aiki<br /> Anakim tirant relying on Nightmares instead of atavisms.<br /> <br /> Naruto<br /> There was a girl from Kurama clan. Basically a Beast, starved insensate.<br /> <br /> why not include other media?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4340,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","user":"Warpwind","date":". 04-20-2018, 10:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","name":"Warpwind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}